Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.06,0:00:03.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.13,0:00:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅塔特隆偷走了我的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron took my grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.46,0:00:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是天使 他们坠落了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels. They're falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.48,0:00:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,想我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅塔特隆 现在你是凡人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron, you're mortal now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.68,0:00:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么除掉血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we get rid of the mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 石碑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I-I don't know. - What about the tablets?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.93,0:00:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,石碑上没有关于血印的记载\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there's nothing in them about the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪打他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.97,0:00:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 不 你的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no! No. Your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.15,0:00:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你去找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take you to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.70,0:00:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于血印有什么发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything about the mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:28.90,Title,0,0,0,0,,也许 我找到了一本《诅咒之书》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I found this "Book of the Damned."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.94,0:00:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去查查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.79,0:00:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.01,0:00:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头见 贱人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrivederci, bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.11,0:00:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rowena?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.73,0:00:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.86,0:00:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,血印不会让宿主轻易死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark of cain never lets its host die easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.19,0:00:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.61,0:00:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.72,0:00:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈说那个血印只不过是个诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother says that mark is just a curse,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.91,0:00:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是可以去掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}can be removed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我挺好的 不劳你费心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不相信血印就是绝症了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't buy that the mark is a terminal diagnosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.26,0:00:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定会有办法的 我们会找到办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has to be a way, and we will find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.40,0:00:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.49,0:01:01.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.04,0:02:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.78,0:02:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要跟踪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why are you following me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.25,0:02:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在跟踪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't following you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.67,0:02:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是跟踪你包里的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm following what you got in your bag there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.79,0:02:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是你的东西 小丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}That don't belong to you, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.03,0:02:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我家族的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Belongs to my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.38,0:02:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 抱歉了 神偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Well, sorry, gambit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.64,0:02:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁找到归谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finders keepers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.69,0:02:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这你无法理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beyond your understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.37,0:02:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本读不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, you can't even read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.62,0:02:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人拿剑指着你的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you always so condescending.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.08,0:02:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总这么拽吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}when someone's pointing a blade at you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.31,0:02:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you look here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.12,0:02:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以砍死我 但我的人绝不会放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can cut me down, but my people will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.71,0:02:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以像在俄国那样小心翼翼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can tiptoe through the tulips like you did in Russia,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.31,0:02:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是像在阿拉斯加那样扒火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you can stow away on the back of a train like you did in Alaska,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.10,0:03:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们家族的人早晚会找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but soon enough, my kin will find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.84,0:03:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果只能是你送命\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ends with you being dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.35,0:03:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逃不了一辈子 小丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't run forever, little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.97,0:03:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第10季第18集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.62,0:03:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们继续经典重放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our flashback playback continues.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.53,0:03:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一首攀升至榜单第四的歌曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a song that climbed all the way to number four on the charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.93,0:03:37.90,Title,0,0,0,0,,请听艾拉妮丝·莫莉塞特的《讽刺》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's Alanis Morissette's "Ironic."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.80,0:03:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.36,0:03:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那首歌多经典啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That song is a classic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.54,0:03:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我懂你意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I hear you. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.65,0:03:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.18,0:03:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,婚礼遭遇恶劣天气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inclement weather on the day of your nuptials.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.82,0:03:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,餐具用错了场合\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the wrong cutlery at inopportune times.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.87,0:03:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪能算讽刺啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}is hardly ironic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.67,0:04:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但很洗脑啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it sure is catchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.57,0:04:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有道理 个人品味没办法嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, fair point. Can't argue taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.98,0:04:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但自从我成了凡人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But since I became human,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.95,0:04:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉好奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's just so…strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.99,0:04:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有那么多的感触\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these feelings, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.64,0:04:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感受到音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I can feel music.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.15,0:04:25.67,Title,0,0,0,0,,比如之前那首歌《苏苏迪奥》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that last song, "Sussudio, "
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.67,0:04:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本不懂 但还是好喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know what it's about and I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.52,0:04:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一向喜欢歌词 文字 故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always enjoyed lyrics, words, stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.37,0:04:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我起鸡皮疙瘩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gives me goose bumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有鸡皮疙瘩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And goose bumps…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.93,0:04:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't even get me started on those.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.52,0:04:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.81,0:04:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,又撩人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet…arousing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.31,0:04:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.09,0:04:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能这就杀了他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I just kill him now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.89,0:04:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我听得到吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I can hear you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.31,0:04:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我们暂时需要他活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we need him alive. For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.86,0:04:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你拿回你的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, after he gives you your grace back,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.34,0:04:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以随意处置他\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can do whatever you want with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.38,0:04:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想慢慢杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'd like to kill him slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.63,0:05:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我离你就两英尺啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am like two feet from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.65,0:05:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,该隐血印查到什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything on the Mark of Cain?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.95,0:05:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个字都听得清清楚楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every word… crystal clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.63,0:05:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.98,0:05:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在找 哪怕微不足道的线索 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I've been digging for something, for anything, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能行吗 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.94,0:05:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是有答案的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is an answer out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.43,0:05:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会为迪恩找到解决办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will find a cure for Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不知道你现在干吗要改变那个暴脾气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why you'd want to cure that little firecracker now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.72,0:05:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他终于好玩点了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's finally interest-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, just keep digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.90,0:05:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 这里没有你找的人 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh, no one here by that name. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.66,0:05:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.69,0:05:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号不好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lose reception?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.61,0:05:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是他挂你电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or did he hang up on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.08,0:05:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他挂你电话了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hung up on you, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.87,0:05:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在反复检查一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I've been checking through everything again,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.66,0:05:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一遍遍地查\N{\fnArial\fs30}double-checking, and triple-checking, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.35,0:05:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,血印是个诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark is a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.06,0:05:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.80,0:05:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sam, it's a…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,它真的是个诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an actual curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.61,0:05:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.57,0:06:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.87,0:06:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者该说罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or rather Rowena told him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.08,0:06:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀我不成后 告诉他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}after she tried and failed to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.25,0:06:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.75,0:06:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,血印保护了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark protected me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.24,0:06:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗威娜倒不是跟我有什么梁子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rowena doesn't really have a beef with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.63,0:06:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是气克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was pissed at Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.16,0:06:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她觉得他变软了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because she thinks he's going soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.57,0:06:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她没说错 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's not wrong. - Yeah, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.09,0:06:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和老妈大吵了一架之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After he and mommy dearest got into a fight…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.17,0:06:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,老妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy dearest?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.86,0:06:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗威娜是克劳力老妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rowena is Crowley's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.66,0:06:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍后详说\N{\fnArial\fs30}More about that later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.94,0:06:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.57,0:06:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就来把她的话告诉了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he came and told me what she had said.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.94,0:06:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,血印是个诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark is an actual curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.91,0:06:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, anyway, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.56,0:06:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我或许早该告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I probably should've told you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.66,0:06:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.78,0:06:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.56,0:06:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,温彻斯特会计行 有什么能帮您的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchester accounting. How may I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.98,0:06:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.48,0:06:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事 你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:07:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好累 还在流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, uh, I'm exhausted and… and I'm bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.59,0:07:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在一个电话亭里 电话亭啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm in a phone booth. A phone booth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.10,0:07:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为这东西只存在于\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know these things existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.45,0:07:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,90年代的电视剧里\N{\fnArial\fs30}outside of "Bill and Ted's"…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.75,0:07:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 深呼吸 丫头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, hey, hey. Take a deep breath, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.25,0:07:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都坐在这儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we're both sitting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.84,0:07:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我怎么回事 你怎么流血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what happened. Why are you bleeding?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.69,0:07:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我中枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh… I got shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.85,0:07:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道牙线拿来缝针很好使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know dental floss works great on stitches?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.66,0:07:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只昏过去两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only passed out twice,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.92,0:07:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我的伤口现在肯定散发薄荷清香了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm pretty sure my wound is now minty fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.90,0:07:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 你大概得去医院吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, you probably need to go to a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.59,0:07:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 我没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, I-I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.67,0:07:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我得去个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got to get someplace safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.13,0:07:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还在追杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys are still after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.98,0:07:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What guys? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.19,0:07:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋南方佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some southern-fried d-bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.49,0:07:41.32,Title,0,0,0,0,,自我挖出了《诅咒之书》他们就一直在追踪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been after me since I-I dug up "The Book of the Damned."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.52,0:07:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到了 在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found it? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.27,0:07:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是找错了几个地方 闯了几家博物馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}After some near misses and some broken-into museums,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.19,0:07:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了些历史文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found historical documents.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.07,0:07:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,并据此找到了西班牙一家修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}that led to a monastery in Spain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.35,0:07:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年前就烧毁了 一片废墟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It burned down years ago, left for dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.06,0:07:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我有种预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, uh, I had this hunch about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.10,0:07:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果我还真对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turned out I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.55,0:07:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 查理 上面怎么说血印的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Charlie, what does it say about the mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.98,0:08:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no fracking idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.72,0:08:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,书里的用语\N{\fnArial\fs30}The language it's written in,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.26,0:08:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我前所未见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.79,0:08:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在修道院的地下室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh… I found some research notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.05,0:08:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了埋书的修道士留下的研究笔记\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the monastery crypt, though, by the friar that buried it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.88,0:08:13.57,Title,0,0,0,0,,《诅咒之书》是一本咒语书\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The book of the damned" is a spell book.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.57,0:08:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是用来创造或解开\N{\fnArial\fs30}for creating or undoing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.61,0:08:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有诅咒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}any kind of damnation there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.53,0:08:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们如果能翻译过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We translate this thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.01,0:08:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得就能把你的该隐血印去掉 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we can get the Mark of Cain off you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 你就是个天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, you're a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.91,0:08:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃命的天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}A genius fugitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.10,0:08:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些追踪我的家伙 他们训练有素\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… these dudes following me, they are well-trained.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.62,0:08:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一个一直说什么他的家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them keeps talking about his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.42,0:08:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,家族 你知道名字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family? Did you get a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.57,0:08:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.30,0:08:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我在一个人身上看到了一个纹身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I spotted a tattoo on one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.15,0:08:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是家族徽章 看上去很邪乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might be a family crest. It seemed occulty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.50,0:08:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一把书挖出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon as the book was out of the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就蜂拥而至\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were all over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.21,0:08:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.43,0:08:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我还能逃多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how much more running I got left in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.79,0:08:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们似乎有办法追踪这本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-they're tracking the book somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.99,0:08:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就得把你藏起来 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then we need to get you off the grid, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.74,0:08:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.53,0:08:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,得梅因南边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, just south of Des Moines.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.86,0:08:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, okay, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.82,0:09:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的朋友鲍比在那一带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our… our friend Bobby has a whole bunch of cabins.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.89,0:09:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有不少小木屋 供猎人暂住\N{\fnArial\fs30}scattered all around, places for hunters to crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.49,0:09:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然一般般\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's not much,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.22,0:09:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有些装备和传说书籍\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's some gear and lore books,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.80,0:09:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以供你打发时间 等我们过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}stuff to keep you busy till we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.10,0:09:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 带吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Bring Snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.75,0:09:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,也带上你们能找到的全部记录者解码戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And every men of letters decoder ring there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.23,0:09:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这本书很古老 很可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}This book is old and scary,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.50,0:09:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过这样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I've never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.29,0:09:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.93,0:09:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在储藏室里找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found this in the storage room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.17,0:09:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,衬铅 有咒文保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's lead-lined and warded.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那些人能追踪到书\N{\fnArial\fs30}If those guys are tracking this book,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.70,0:09:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西肯定能屏蔽它的信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}pretty sure this bad boy will take it off the radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.35,0:09:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.97,0:09:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.63,0:09:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.99,0:09:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 我只是好一阵没见过你这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing I just haven't seen you like this in a while, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.73,0:09:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是首好歌啊 你闭嘴吧 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a good song, man. Shut up. - Yeah, it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.56,0:10:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 这几周以来 糟心事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, it has been one crap sandwich after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.88,0:10:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一桩接一桩\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the past few weeks, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.18,0:10:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到查理的话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.79,0:10:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有机会解决这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a shot at fixing this thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.93,0:10:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这还不能让你振奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}so if that don't put gas in your tank, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.42,0:10:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个「机会」是一本我们读不懂的书里的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}If by "shot, " you mean a spell in a book that we can't read.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.78,0:10:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这本书目前在被人追踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's currently being tracked…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.92,0:10:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该赢一把了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're due for a win, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.09,0:10:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,早该了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Overdue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.29,0:10:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再告诉你一件事 如果这事真成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you another thing, if this actually does work,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.27,0:10:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要休一阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna take some time off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.27,0:10:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,度假吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, like a vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.77,0:10:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且不是去维加斯度个周末\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not talking just like a weekend in vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.59,0:10:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是在哪个破旅馆里 看付费黄片\N{\fnArial\fs30}or sitting in some crap motel watching pay-per-porn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.89,0:10:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要去海滩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm talking about a beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.35,0:10:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝鸡尾酒 去游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drinking cervezas, go for a swim,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.16,0:10:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟当地野生动物一起玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}mingle with the local wildlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.14,0:10:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上次去海滩都是什么时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was the last time either one of us was on a beach?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.05,0:10:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没去过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.70,0:10:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.26,0:10:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚踩在沙滩上 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sand between our toes, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.08,0:10:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚踩在沙滩上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sand between our toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.53,0:11:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的我（上帝）啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}O…m…me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.26,0:11:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.94,0:11:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,美味的食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glorious food.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.77,0:11:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么多书里 有那么丰富的描绘\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the countless descriptions in so many books,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.08,0:11:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那也只是言语\N{\fnArial\fs30}but those are just words.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.97,0:11:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这味道 真实的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}The taste, the… the actual taste…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.32,0:11:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.36,0:11:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这个过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the process…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.13,0:11:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goes in here…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.03,0:11:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comes out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.69,0:12:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直是巫术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorcery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.43,0:12:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也做过人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you used to be human.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想念这一切吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you miss all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.02,0:12:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不想念消化\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I don't miss digestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.21,0:12:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不想念消化不良\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't miss indigestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.02,0:12:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 不是那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.86,0:12:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想念这一切的感觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, don't you miss the feeling of all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.23,0:12:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如这华夫饼的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the taste of these waffles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.50,0:12:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子的笑声\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sound of a child's laughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.03,0:12:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.75,0:12:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这两个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're a couple of angels who've touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.63,0:12:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅接触过神明 也知晓人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}not only the divine, but the mundane.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有很多共同点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I have a lot in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.02,0:12:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,少来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.99,0:12:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.37,0:12:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我们挺愉快呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we were having a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.93,0:12:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就不能做好闺蜜吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't we be besties?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.93,0:12:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,休想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.14,0:12:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你杀了我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you killed my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.39,0:12:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 迪恩不是没事吗 基本没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, pbht. Dean is fine, mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.40,0:12:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能忘了那事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you get past that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.45,0:12:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.50,0:12:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经找了你三个安全屋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we've hit three of your so-called safe houses,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.51,0:12:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,却都空无一物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all of them are empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.45,0:13:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你要么是把我的能量弄丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So either you've lost my grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.19,0:13:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么你是在拖延\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you're stalling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.04,0:13:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能怪我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you blame me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.31,0:13:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一交出你的能量 我就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The minute I hand over your grace, I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.89,0:13:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是自作自受 梅塔特隆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have made your bed, Metatron,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.29,0:13:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你休想逃避你的命运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nothing is going to get you out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.12,0:13:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.00,0:13:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去下洗手间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I need to use the little boys' room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.62,0:13:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.93,0:13:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.11,0:14:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.40,0:14:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.75,0:14:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人跟踪你们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you followed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.50,0:14:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.85,0:14:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.25,0:14:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚可能昏过去了 但我好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may have just passed out, but better.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.66,0:14:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,书呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the book?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.18,0:14:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我目前查到了这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here's what I've learned so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.88,0:14:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概七百年前 一个修女看到了「黑暗幻象」\N{\fnArial\fs30}About 700 years ago, a nun locked herself away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.88,0:14:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是把自己关了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}after having "visions of darkness."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.02,0:14:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,独自躲了几十年后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After a few decades squirrelled away by herself,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.38,0:14:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她带着这个重新出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}she emerged with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.51,0:14:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一页都是用她自己的皮肤做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each page is made out of slices of her own skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.04,0:14:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,用她的血书成\N{\fnArial\fs30}written in her blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.81,0:14:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 很诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, it's eekish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.05,0:14:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,据我找到的笔记说\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to the notes I found,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.06,0:14:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,书一直在各种邪教 巫师团之间辗转\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's been owned and used by cults, covens,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.79,0:14:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至还曾落入罗马教廷之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Vatican had it for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.34,0:14:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面什么样的咒语都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a spell inside that thing for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.30,0:15:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑弥撒 黑魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talking some black mass, dark magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.00,0:15:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可怕的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}end-of-times nastiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.34,0:15:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于这是什么语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as what language it's written in,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.83,0:15:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking it's some kind of, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.69,0:15:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean? Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.59,0:15:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.84,0:15:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我最好还是别碰这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it's a good idea that I touch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.44,0:15:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去取我们其他的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go get the rest of our crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.31,0:15:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.68,0:15:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.20,0:15:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他情况并没有好转\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not getting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.97,0:15:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想掩盖\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's trying to cover, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.01,0:15:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到解决办法 得尽快\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find that cure, fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.24,0:15:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉搞得那么乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about the mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.54,0:15:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定是有乳糖不耐症\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'm lactose intolerant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.91,0:15:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再别提那事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's never speak of it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.84,0:15:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅塔特隆和卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron and Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.64,0:16:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是我的幸运日\N{\fnArial\fs30}This really must be my lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.23,0:16:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,一剑二鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two birds, one blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.31,0:16:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.49,0:16:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是个丘比特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, just a cupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.44,0:16:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常生气的丘比特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just an angry, angry cupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.35,0:16:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解你的恼怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand you're upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.43,0:16:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都败坏了天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You both corrupted heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.97,0:16:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不能回到过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's never gonna be the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.63,0:16:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我欠你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owed you that one, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.95,0:16:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这并不能改变什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}This changes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.80,0:17:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.45,0:17:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看清了那个纹身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I got a pretty good look at his tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.79,0:17:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.80,0:17:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋家族 了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}The douche clan. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.35,0:17:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是记录者所有的异教家族的记录了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is everything men of letters had on occult families,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.29,0:17:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里应该能找到点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}so there should be something in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.65,0:17:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, got anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.55,0:17:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.21,0:17:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一种少见的苏美尔方言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, it's all in an obscure Sumerian dialect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.02,0:17:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这本书中找到了大致匹配的字符\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually found a rough match for it in this book.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.27,0:17:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.36,0:17:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也觉得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought so, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.21,0:17:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我翻译了半天\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've been translating,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.16,0:17:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻译出来的东西都不成话\N{\fnArial\fs30}but none of the translated words make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.10,0:17:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是胡言乱语\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all just gibberish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.49,0:17:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是另一种方言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, maybe it's in a different dialect?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.19,0:17:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.21,0:17:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的 但我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right, but I-I think…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.75,0:17:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这是密文\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this is in code.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.03,0:17:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一本用读不懂的语言写的密文书\N{\fnArial\fs30}An entire book of unreadable text that's also in code.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.95,0:17:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.38,0:17:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还自称是死书呆子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you call yourselves nerds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.86,0:17:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你们行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.25,0:17:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.23,0:18:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,开启阿兰·图灵模式嘛 破解密文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get our Alan Turing on, decrypt this bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.11,0:18:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.80,0:18:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.28,0:18:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先用我的笔记研究吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, why don't we stick with my notes for a little bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.82,0:18:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这书真是看得我眼睛疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}This book is literally making my eyes hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.39,0:18:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.57,0:19:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.14,0:19:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她找到隐藏书的办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She found a way to hide the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.09,0:19:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.22,0:19:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这条路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was on this road.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.08,0:19:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她走过这条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was on this road.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.54,0:19:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们沿路找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send the boys up and down the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.78,0:19:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看有没有人见过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}see if anybody saw her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.08,0:19:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.01,0:19:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指望我相信你把我的能量藏在了图书馆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You expect me to believe that you hid my grace in a library?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.69,0:19:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今都没人去图书馆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody goes to libraries anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.05,0:19:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是世界上最安全的地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the safest place in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.56,0:19:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉到我的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel my grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.67,0:19:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这里 但被你藏起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's here, but you've hidden it somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.12,0:19:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.42,0:19:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.88,0:19:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.27,0:19:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.79,0:19:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让另一个天使藏了起来 我都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had another angel hide it, even from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.50,0:19:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是为了防止\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, in case someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:20:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人想折磨我得到情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}tries to torture the information out of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.82,0:20:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,说中了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Case in point!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.75,0:20:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的能量在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is my grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.81,0:20:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫那个天使把线索藏在一些我最喜欢的书里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told the angel to hide some clues in some of my favorite books.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.00,0:20:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother, may I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.75,0:20:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,「一个人能做的最疯狂的事是什么」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What is the maddest thing a man can do?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.23,0:20:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谜语吗 答案是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a riddle? What… what's the answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.84,0:20:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道 我才做了一天的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beats me. I've only been a man a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.36,0:20:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谜语的谜底\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, the… the answer to the riddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.17,0:20:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,会指向另一本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}will lead to another book.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.09,0:20:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那本书里 有你的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}And inside that book, you'll find your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会破解的 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna work this out together, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.12,0:20:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,团队合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teamwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.27,0:21:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 就算是布莱切利四人组也破解不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, even the Bletchley Circle couldn't crack this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.20,0:21:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经试遍了各种密码算法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've tried every cryptographic algorithm there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.16,0:21:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goose egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.79,0:21:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许这也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe that's not such a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.14,0:21:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些跟踪你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those people following you…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.06,0:21:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,各种可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}All kinds of wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.17,0:21:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,几代人 几个世纪都一直很可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talking multi-generational, centuries-old wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.67,0:21:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯戴恩家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Styne family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.99,0:21:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据记录者的文件 他们能追溯到19世纪初\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men of letters' files have them dated back to the early 1800s.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.35,0:21:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们用咒语制造疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}They used spells to create disease,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.96,0:21:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦解市场\N{\fnArial\fs30}to destabilize markets.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.14,0:21:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至在纳粹掌权前就帮过他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, they even helped the Nazis before they came into power,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.96,0:21:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还借此从中牟利\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they profited from all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.45,0:21:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么他们就是超自然的杜邦家族吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, they're like the supernatural Du Ponts?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.21,0:21:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.93,0:21:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们用的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the spells they used.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.90,0:21:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,都来自一本「极邪恶之书」\N{\fnArial\fs30}came from a book of "Unspeakable evil, "
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.10,0:21:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们大概一百多年前弄丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which they lost nearly 100 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.67,0:21:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 他们很坏 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so they're bad. So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.43,0:21:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对付过更坏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We faced worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.77,0:21:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 好好读资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, read the file.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.17,0:21:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,书的效果就是 你用书\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way the book works is when you use it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.27,0:21:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会产生负面反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is a negative reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.64,0:21:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,程度很强\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking biblical negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.09,0:22:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑魔法总是有代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dark magic always comes with a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.42,0:22:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我们知道 这路我们走过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know that. We've been down that road before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.87,0:22:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们至少翻译出来 看看什么内容啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's at least translate it, see what it says.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.78,0:22:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.28,0:22:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从我看到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}The book's been calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.34,0:22:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这书就一直在召唤我\N{\fnArial\fs30}ever since I laid eyes on it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.71,0:22:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,召唤血印 我能听到 就好像它是活物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calling out to the mark. I can hear it like it's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.76,0:22:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,它想要我用它 做坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wants me to use it, but not for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.49,0:22:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也希望这就是解答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I wanted it to be the answer, too, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.38,0:22:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.67,0:22:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们必须把书销毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have got to get rid of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.87,0:22:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧掉 埋了 我不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn it, bury it, I don't give a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得另想办法解决血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just have to find another way to fix the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.21,0:22:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.40,0:22:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.92,0:22:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要放弃了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.24,0:22:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是要放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.43,0:22:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 我又不是想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, I don't have a death wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.79,0:22:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是想 我也死不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, even if I did, I can't die,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.74,0:22:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我胳膊上这东西不让我死\N{\fnArial\fs30}not with this thing on my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.84,0:22:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我能尽可能地抵抗它 直到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I can do is I can fight it as long as I can until…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.24,0:22:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.11,0:22:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.46,0:22:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到什么时候 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until what, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.49,0:22:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我看着你再次变成恶魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until I watch you become a demon again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.10,0:22:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到那时吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until then?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.78,0:22:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.25,0:22:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不会那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.48,0:22:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你只能把我关起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then you'll just have to lock me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.87,0:23:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,像之前那样 把我锁进地堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bind me to the bunker like you did last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.29,0:23:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这什么都解决不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't solve anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.10,0:23:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们先把书翻译了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, just let us translate the book, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.84,0:23:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有治愈办法 我们就去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's a cure, we'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.22,0:23:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么后果之后再应付\N{\fnArial\fs30}and deal with the consequences later.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.71,0:23:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能失去你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't lose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.89,0:23:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.61,0:23:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.68,0:23:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在改主意了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You change your mind on that,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.61,0:23:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次你可不是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause that's not what you said last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.70,0:23:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 你知道我不是真心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, man. You know I didn't mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.15,0:23:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的负担 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my cross to bear, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.85,0:23:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.59,0:23:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那本书里没有答案的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that book is not the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.40,0:23:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得赶紧处理掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we got to destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.20,0:23:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,以免它落入恶人之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}before it falls into the wrong hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.71,0:23:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这恶人也包括我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that includes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.94,0:23:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出去兜兜风\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go for a drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.58,0:23:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 我们刚刚忘了给你带点吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Charlie, we forgot to pick up your snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.78,0:23:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, look…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.71,0:23:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以另想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll figure out another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.58,0:23:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我有天会去度假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Sam, I'll get my vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.90,0:23:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是今天 不是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not today. Not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.13,0:23:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.89,0:23:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.63,0:24:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 一定有办法的 一定有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there's a way to fix it. There has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.62,0:24:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得咱俩组队还挺搭的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we really do make a good team.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.16,0:24:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点像双口相声 只不过没说相声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of like a buddy comedy without the comedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.70,0:24:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是一对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the buddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.50,0:24:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, now, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.24,0:24:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前在小餐馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back at the diner,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.07,0:24:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是演了一出激情四射的双人动作片嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was some pretty awesome dynamic-duo action.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.60,0:24:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一场悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we did back there was unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.66,0:24:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不该再有兄弟姐妹丧命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more of our brothers and sisters should die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.41,0:24:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brothers and sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.12,0:24:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.01,0:24:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还念叨着公司宗旨 好像还有人在乎似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still spitting out the company line like anyone cares.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.65,0:24:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像我们真是一家人似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like we're actually a family?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.10,0:24:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我们不过是一群光\N{\fnArial\fs30}When what we really are are a bunch of glowing lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.70,0:24:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么自怨自艾 要么狂妄自大\N{\fnArial\fs30}filled with self-loathing or delusions of grandeur.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.44,0:24:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或两者皆有 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or both. - You shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.65,0:24:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.96,0:24:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死也要死个明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm gonna die, I want answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.84,0:24:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 你现在究竟算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, who are you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.49,0:24:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你显然已经不是上帝的天使了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, you're obviously not an angel of the Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.10,0:25:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.02,0:25:05.58,Title,0,0,0,0,,像{\u1}《功夫》{\u0}里的凯恩似的在人间行侠仗义算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}"walking the earth like Caine from 'Kung Fu'" crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.93,0:25:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,忙着给天堂擦屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cleaning up heaven's messes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.53,0:25:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面还有多少变坏的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many more rogue angels are there out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.95,0:25:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,等这一切结束 你又要怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what are you gonna do once you're done with all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.04,0:25:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,回天堂吗 得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back to heaven? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.79,0:25:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前那个叫汉娜的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angel formerly known as Hannah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.99,0:25:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经恢复了天堂的秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}has restored order up top.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.31,0:25:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,自上帝给天堂之门剪彩之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smoothest it's run since.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.16,0:25:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是天堂运作最平稳的时期了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God cut the ribbon on the pearly gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.38,0:25:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说句真心话 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tell me, Castiel, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.96,0:25:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在的使命究竟是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is your mission now?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.49,0:25:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 接着找\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shut up and keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.25,0:25:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.54,0:25:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}cannot say…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.01,0:25:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没尽力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't try.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.48,0:26:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,小可怜卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.15,0:26:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,游了这么远 却淹死在了一个小池塘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swam so far just to drown in shallow waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.02,0:26:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是很讽刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it ironic?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.14,0:26:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ya think?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.45,0:26:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚迪恩是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did Dean mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.37,0:26:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说你改了主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he said you changed your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.32,0:26:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前 我们曾有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, a while back, we had a chance to, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.49,0:26:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}close the gates of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.37,0:27:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要完成这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in order to do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.22,0:27:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've had to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.31,0:27:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己并不介意 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was okay with that and I am okay with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.07,0:27:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但迪恩接受不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Dean was not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.15,0:27:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so he, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.99,0:27:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.72,0:27:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.74,0:27:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let me guess,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.06,0:27:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了救你 他做了一些你不希望他做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}in doing so, he did something you didn't want.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.03,0:27:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你惹怒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that pissed you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.86,0:27:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是你就说了一些伤人的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you said something that hurt him?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.89,0:27:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 差不多就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that sounds about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.24,0:27:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.97,0:27:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做猎人才没多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I haven't been a hunter for very long,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.49,0:27:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得这份生活就是如此了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it feels like this is the life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.97,0:27:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,总要面对两难的选择 死亡 或泪水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly ends in Sophie's choices, death, or tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.25,0:27:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常三者兼有 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Usually all of the above, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.57,0:27:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的人生怎么就成了这样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did this become my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.80,0:28:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本打算自己开个公司 娶个女神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I was gonna own my own start-up, marry ScarJo,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.12,0:28:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,发明个酷酷的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}invent something cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.84,0:28:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm just…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.09,0:28:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,只庆幸自己还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just happy to be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.54,0:28:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初迪恩来大学找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, when Dean came to get me at school,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.55,0:28:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I told myself…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.70,0:28:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最后一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}One last job, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.26,0:28:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,再做一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more job.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.69,0:28:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后当我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then when … when I, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.20,0:28:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我失去杰西时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I lost Jess,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.43,0:28:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再一次告诉自己 这是最后一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, again, told myself, one more job.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.34,0:28:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是永远有下一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always one more job, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.57,0:28:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次又一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one more job and one more job,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.09,0:28:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后我就回法学院 回归正常生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I was gonna go back to law and … and to my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.74,0:28:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就是猎人界的「{\u1}海盗罗伯茨{\u0}」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were the Dread Pirate Roberts of hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.69,0:28:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.03,0:28:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我现在明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I really understand now that…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.63,0:28:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.38,0:28:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我热爱它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.27,0:29:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不能没有我哥一个人承受\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't do it without my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.20,0:29:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想一个人承受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to do it without my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.62,0:29:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他不在了 我不知道我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he's gone, then I don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.93,0:29:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I got it. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.05,0:29:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,先干重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, first things first …
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.27,0:29:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到我此行的真正目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find what I really came here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.45,0:29:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,「人生成功的两个因素」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What two things do you need to succeed in life?"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.71,0:29:41.76,Title,0,0,0,0,,《无知和自信》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ignorance and confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.76,0:29:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是引述\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're quotes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.64,0:29:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.41,0:29:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你的小伙伴真以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}…did you and samateur hour really think.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.93,0:29:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会没有后备计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't have a backup plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.28,0:29:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到你了 恶魔石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, demon tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.54,0:30:02.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（唐吉可德）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.21,0:30:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带着它 去好多地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}The places I'll go with this,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.95,0:30:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.04,0:30:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,能拿到一个也不错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, one out of two ain't bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.04,0:30:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人能做的最疯狂的事是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the maddest thing a man can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.63,0:30:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,任自己死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let himself die.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.16,0:31:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝创造的生灵总有一死 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}God just don't build to last, does he?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.37,0:31:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,下午好 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afternoon, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.87,0:31:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.87,0:31:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,结账\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.85,0:31:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll be it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.78,0:31:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 就这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.39,0:31:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 一共15.75美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then. That'll be $15.75.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.37,0:31:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是要回家 还是只是路过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heading home, or you just passing through?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.59,0:31:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,路过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just passing through.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.34,0:31:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么大地方只有你一个人很孤独吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must get awful lonely out here all by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.31,0:31:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还过得去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I get by.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.72,0:31:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.62,0:31:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,手放在我能看到的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands where I can see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.97,0:32:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要你的找零了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you want your change?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.26,0:32:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.28,0:32:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who might you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.08,0:32:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hello, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.84,0:32:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么个无名之徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd a back-road nothing like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.39,0:32:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会弄到这样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}get their hands on something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.61,0:32:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你管我呢 斯戴恩先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it to you, Mr. Styne?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.11,0:32:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友叫我雅各布\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friends call me Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.64,0:32:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I ain't your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.14,0:32:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不会是给一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}These wouldn't happen to be treats.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.73,0:32:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,红发小妞买的食物吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a redheaded little gal, now, would they?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.18,0:32:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们藏了那本书 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all hid the book, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.63,0:32:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜 是衬铅的什么东西吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lead-lined little number, I'm betting.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.70,0:32:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what the hell you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.89,0:33:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.62,0:33:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.66,0:33:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,柜子后面的死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That man back there,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.51,0:33:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟这一路上的卡车休息站\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, he said the same thing as all the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.33,0:33:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,和加油站的人说的话一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}at truck stops and gas stations up and down the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.27,0:33:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人见过那个红头发的姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody had seen that redheaded girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.59,0:33:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后一个身上有血印的男人进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then a man bearing that mark comes in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.58,0:33:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,来到我面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.66,0:33:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些事是巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's coincidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.87,0:33:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些事是天意\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then there's just providence.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.45,0:33:32.30,Title,0,0,0,0,,你瞧 《诅咒之书》它想要被找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, "The book of the damned, " it wants to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.30,0:33:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,它想要回到我手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wants to come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.55,0:33:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.33,0:33:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想用书\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.24,0:33:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,去掉你手臂上的恩赐 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get that gift off your arm, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.24,0:33:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,力量放在弱者身上就浪费了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power is wasted on the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.83,0:33:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这本书…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the book…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.83,0:33:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以去掉血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}can remove that mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.23,0:33:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但假如你使用了那本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you mess around with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.39,0:34:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果将会弊远大于利\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna do far more harm than good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.01,0:34:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你何不做正确的事呢 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why don't you do the right thing here, boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.74,0:34:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我书在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell me where that book is?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.77,0:34:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我会告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure, I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.41,0:34:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一次 我没听见\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more time. I didn't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.75,0:34:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.20,0:34:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.54,0:35:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯戴恩家族 他们找到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Stynes, they found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.61,0:35:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些混蛋身体强化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those douches are all jacked up, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.72,0:35:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.08,0:35:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打空了一整个弹匣才把其中一个打死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I emptied a full clip into one of them before the son of a bitch went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.34,0:35:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你要用圣油干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what are you doing with the holy oil?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.97,0:35:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那本书里的确有祛除血印的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a cure for the mark in the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.83,0:35:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it comes at a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.58,0:35:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得毁了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.61,0:35:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.69,0:35:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在召唤我 萨姆 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's calling to me, Sam, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.66,0:35:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能听见 它在召唤血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hear it. It's calling to the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.13,0:35:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,它希望我带着书逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wants me to take the book and run away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.62,0:35:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧了它 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn it, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.08,0:35:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 马上烧了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, burn it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.60,0:36:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个傻小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You silly boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.86,0:37:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太傻 太自私了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was foolish, selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.04,0:37:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,真该直接杀了他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should've just killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.41,0:37:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道他会拿那块石碑做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows what he'll do with that tablet?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.11,0:37:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know what, Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.12,0:37:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿回了自己的能量 你满血复活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got your grace back. You're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.24,0:37:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.93,0:37:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也做了正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.55,0:37:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那本书必须被销毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}That book needed to be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.58,0:37:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到其他办法的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will find another way, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.59,0:37:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回来了 贱人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're back, bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.95,0:37:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我想的那个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that who I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.34,0:37:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 这是小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.34,0:37:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 这是查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.75,0:37:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你没这么高呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd be shorter.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.30,0:37:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把这些放进冰箱里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get these to the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.68,0:38:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你拿回了自己的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard you got your mojo back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.81,0:38:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我的…能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my … my grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.80,0:38:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经恢复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's … it's been restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.67,0:38:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 你不能直接…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, can't you just, you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.31,0:38:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,治好迪恩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}cure Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.57,0:38:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不幸 没那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, it's not that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.16,0:38:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来就没简单过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never is, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.85,0:38:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你能治好我的腕管吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think you could do anything about my carpal tunnel?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.76,0:38:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.90,0:38:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的腕管和枪伤都治好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your carpal tunnel and your bullet wound are now healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.04,0:38:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你晚上最好还是戴着护腕睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may want to continue wearing your wrist brace at night, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.96,0:38:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是不是刚刚成为死党了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we just become best friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.54,0:38:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这是谁来了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look who decided to show.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.03,0:38:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你恢复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So? You're back?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.40,0:38:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分百\N{\fnArial\fs30}100%?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.18,0:38:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.72,0:39:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是汉娜的功劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, it was Hannah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.46,0:39:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她设法从梅塔特隆口中问出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She managed to get the location of the.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.22,0:39:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我剩余能量的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}remainder of my grace out of Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.71,0:39:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.06,0:39:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说我们该赢一把了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you we were due for a win.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.44,0:39:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能恢复太好了 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to have you back, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.30,0:40:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.74,0:40:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,也永远不会信\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…I never will.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.05,0:40:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.20,0:40:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这正是你擅长的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is right in your wheelhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.90,0:40:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 马上烧了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, burn it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.36,0:40:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个傻小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You silly boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.51,0:41:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家族永远不会停止寻找那本书的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family will never stop looking for that book.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.19,0:41:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要把该隐血印从我哥哥身上弄掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the mark of Cain off of my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.28,0:41:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我觉得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And something tells me…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.97,0:41:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能破解这本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can crack this book.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.09,0:41:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,并找到解决办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}and find that cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.49,0:41:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的问题是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only question is…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.82,0:41:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}will you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.20,0:41:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈谈条件吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we discuss terms?
